  "name": {
   "zh": "HDRI · LuxDiT",
   "en": "HDRI · LuxDiT"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "LuxDiT 微调一个视频扩散 transformer，按画面生成 HDR 环境贴图，光照准确并保住与画面的语义对应。这张卡交付环境 HDRI（经纬图，EXR 的 rgba）；画面外的环境是模型猜的，对随机种子敏感。",
   "en": "LuxDiT fine-tunes a video diffusion transformer to generate an HDR environment map from images, with accurate lighting and semantic consistency with the image. This card delivers an environment HDRI (lat-long, the EXR's rgba); the environment outside the frame is guessed by the model and is sensitive to the seed."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
